sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant P as primary (shard D0)
  participant S1 as OSD shard D1
  participant SP as OSD shard P
  participant SQ as OSD shard Q
  C->>P: write 4K at an offset inside D1
  P->>S1: read D1_old (only that 4K)
  P->>SP: read P_old (same extent)
  P->>SQ: read Q_old (same extent)
  S1-->>P: D1_old
  SP-->>P: P_old
  SQ-->>P: Q_old
  Note over P: encode_delta: Δ = D1_old ⊕ D1_new
  Note over P: apply_delta: P_new = P_old ⊕ c41·Δ and Q_new = Q_old ⊕ c51·Δ
  P->>S1: write D1_new
  P->>SP: write P_new
  P->>SQ: write Q_new
  S1-->>P: commit
  SP-->>P: commit
  SQ-->>P: commit
  P-->>C: ack
